  "statement_html": "<p>Jean-Christophe emprunte <span class=\"bold\">9000 &euro;</span> à la banque, au taux de <span class=\"bold\">4.7 %</span> et rembourse son prêt en trois annuités. </p>\t<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder wims_matrix\">\n  <tr><th>Année</th> <th>Capital restant dû</th> <th>Amortissement</th> <th>Intérêts</th> <th>Annuité</th></tr>\n  <tr><th>1</th> <td>9000</td> <td>2863.32</td> <td>423</td> <td>3286.32</td></tr>\n  <tr><th>2</th> <td>6136.68</td> <td>2997.9</td> <td>288.42</td> <td>3286.32</td></tr>\n  <tr><th>3</th> <td>3138.78</td> <td>3138.78</td> <td>147.54</td> <td>3286.32</td></tr>\n</table></div>\t\t\t<div class=\"wims_question\">\t <ol>\t   <li>Quel est le <label for=\"reply1\">montant d'une annuité</label> ?   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"6\"></span> </li>\t   <li>Les annuités sont <span class=\"bold\"> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"1\">constantes</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"2\">dégressives</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"3\">progressives</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply2\" data-pos=\"4\">alternatives</span></span> (cliquer sur la bonne réponse) </li>\t   <li>Les intérêts sont<span class=\"bold\"> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"1\">constants</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"2\">dégressifs</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"3\">progressifs</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply3\" data-pos=\"4\">alternatifs</span></span> (cliquer sur la bonne réponse)</li>\t   <li>Les amortissements sont<span class=\"bold\"> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply6\" data-pos=\"1\">constants</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply6\" data-pos=\"2\">dégressifs</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply6\" data-pos=\"3\">progressifs</span> <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply6\" data-pos=\"4\">alternatifs</span></span> (cliquer sur la bonne réponse)</li>\t   <li>Les amortissements forment une <span class=\"bold\">suite géométrique</span>,\t   quelle en est la <label for=\"reply5\">raison</label> ?  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"6\"></span></li>\t   <li>Quel est le <label for=\"reply4\">coût du prêt</label>?  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"6\"></span></li>\t </ol>\t</div>\t\t",
